[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1320.63, "timestamp": "00:22:00", "text": "需要 10 分钟。 我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1323.19, "timestamp": "00:22:03", "text": "意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1326.47, "timestamp": "00:22:06", "text": "从 YouTube API 获取所有视频流最多只需要 1 秒钟。 然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1329.27, "timestamp": "00:22:09", "text": "它必须把每一样东西都绘制出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1332.149, "timestamp": "00:22:12", "text": "。 不。是的。 是的。 最多需要 10"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1334.87, "timestamp": "00:22:14", "text": "分钟，因为它必须检查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1338.47, "timestamp": "00:22:18", "text": "内部文件，比如我有两个文件，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1341.029, "timestamp": "00:22:21", "text": "一个是主注册表，另一个是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1342.95, "timestamp": "00:22:22", "text": "流文件。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1346.149, "timestamp": "00:22:26", "text": "它会检查检查检查，看看是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1349.51, "timestamp": "00:22:29", "text": "即将开始，所有这些操作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1352.87, "timestamp": "00:22:32", "text": "大约需要 10 到 20 分钟。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1356.39, "timestamp": "00:22:36", "text": "必须想办法缩短时间，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1359.029, "timestamp": "00:22:39", "text": "所以，像今天这样的直播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1361.83, "timestamp": "00:22:41", "text": "我会在直播开始前 10 分钟突然安排我的直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1365.19, "timestamp": "00:22:45", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1367.669, "timestamp": "00:22:47", "text": "然后就直接上线了。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1370.47, "timestamp": "00:22:50", "text": "现在的情况是，我不能在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1374.47, "timestamp": "00:22:54", "text": "Discord 上宣布我正在直播，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1377.27, "timestamp": "00:22:57", "text": "可以手动宣布，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1379.43, "timestamp": "00:22:59", "text": "现在已经设置了自动化程序。 我得等"}]